    "title": "2D Prefix Sum: Problem #82 (Stripe Placement Classic)",
    "description": "Given the placement scenario at Stripe, solve the following 2D Prefix Sum problem:\n\nYou are given an input sequence representing transactional or relational data. Implement an optimal algorithmic function to evaluate the 2d prefix sum criteria, handling all boundary edge cases.\n\nExample 1:\nInput: data = [2, 7, 11, 15], target = 9\nOutput: [0, 1]\nExplanation: Indices 0 and 1 sum to 9.\n\nConstraints:\n- 1 <= N <= 2 * 10^5\n- Time Limit: 1.0 second\n- Memory Limit: 256 MB",
    "topic": "Prefix Sum & Range Queries",
    "subtopic": "2D Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "pattern": "2D Prefix Sum",
